# Signed-out password reset. The code arrives in Mailpit (http://localhost:8025).

### Request a reset (202, same answer whether the address exists)
# @name reset
POST {{host}}/v1/identity/password-resets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Confirm with the code (204, signs every session out)
POST {{host}}/v1/identity/password-resets/{{reset.response.body.id}}/confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "123456", "newPassword": "{{password}}" }

### Realtime stream: 403 until a business module grants membership
GET {{host}}/v1/stream?businessId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer <token from sessions.http>
